The [[Blood Amulet]] is a legendary [[Accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. It gives some {{icon/vampirism}} and maximum health. On its own, it is a useful defensive item, especially with multiple [[melee]] [[weapon]]s, but it's at its best as a crafting material for various [[Vampiric]] items. In general, these crafts deliver slightly more {{icon/vampirism}} than the base [[Blood Amulet]]. The [[Blood Amulet]] is also a needed catalyst to create the [[Vampiric Potion]] from the [[Strong Health Potion]] and the [[Red Orchid Collar]] from the [[Acorn Collar]].
